<title>USA: JLG Industries started with buy rating.</title>
<headline>JLG Industries started with buy rating.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities analyst Cliff Ransom said he initiated coverage of JLG Industries Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>&quot;JLG is leading the charge into new channels, new applications, new dealer networks and new end markets with its broad product offerings,&quot; Ransom said.</p>
<p>&quot;The company has already broken all previous records for new products with its fiscal 1996 initiatives.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/2 at 19-1/2.</p>
</text>
